setting-clipboard-files-desc = Also let copied files through, in the clipboard's direction. Off, only text and pictures are shared.
setting-keep-awake = Keep the screen on in full screen
setting-keep-awake-desc = While a full-screen desktop is in front, this computer doesn't turn off the screen, lock or go to sleep. It does again as soon as you switch away or leave full screen.
settings-keyboard = Keyboard
setting-fullscreen-key = Ctrl+Alt+Enter switches full screen
setting-fullscreen-key-desc = Switch between full screen and a window from the keyboard. Off, Windows gets Ctrl+Alt+Enter. Ctrl+Alt+M (minimize) and Ctrl+Alt+D (disconnect) always work: this FreeRDP version can't turn them off.
setting-system-shortcuts = Send shortcuts like Super and Alt+Tab to the desktop
setting-system-shortcuts-desc = While the pointer is over the desktop's window, COSMIC's shortcuts go to Windows. Press and release Right Ctrl to get them back; moving the pointer out of the window does too.
setting-reconnect = Reconnect after a lost connection
setting-reconnect-desc = When the network drops or the computer wakes from sleep, connect again by itself, waiting a little longer each time. Desktops that use a Windows password aren't reconnected by themselves.
setting-reconnect-attempts = Reconnect attempts
setting-reconnect-attempts-desc = How many times to try before giving up. The waits between tries grow from 5 seconds to 1 minute.
